                                "sense_id": "8fc274f0-ed68-3133-9187-b5c94c5c1d26",
                                "text": "But said corporation shall not acquire title to any land, nor enter upon any street, until all damages to the owners of land and abutters on any part of a street occupied, or to be occupied, by its structure have been paid or secured[…]"
